# VOLLT for TAPVizieR
G.Landais (19-oct-2020)


2 main branches :
- master: originale VOLLT version (Greg.Mantelet)
  original GIT repository : https://github.com/gmantele/vollt
- tapvizier: contains TAPVizieR updates

## pull : get new VOLLT version 

1. get the new version in the master branch
git checkout master
git pull greg master
(note see remote repository: git remote -v)

2. put the update in the tapvizier branch
git checkout tapvizier
git rebase

## push a new verion in tapvizier branch
git checkout tapvizier
git add...
git commit
git push origin tapvizier

