## Merge withi a gmantele branch

Add vollt/origin from gmanetele in the current project (upstream is just a name) 

- git remote add upstream https://github.com/gmantele/vollt.git

- git fetch upstream  
(apparait dans git branch -a):

- pull a given gmeantele branch:
git pull upstream/fix-base-url


